BEHAVIOR receive

DESCRIPTION
  Receives data from a connected socket.
  Blocks until data available or connection closed.
  Returns number of bytes received.
  Returns 0 on connection closed, negative on error.

CONTRACT
  INPUT fd int 8
  INPUT max_length int 8
  OUTPUT buffer bytes 65536
  OUTPUT bytes_received int 8
  GUARANTEES writes_output

HASH 2ae7614b

NATIVE
